				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;accordion mt-2&#34; id=&#34;release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0_accordion&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;accordion-header&#34; id=&#34;release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button&#xA;        class=&#34;accordion-button&#34;&#xA;        type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-target=&#34;#release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;        aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;        aria-controls=&#34;release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      &gt;Changelog&lt;span class=&#34;badge rounded-pill bg-secondary ms-1&#34;&gt;22&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xA;      id=&#34;release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse show&#34;&#xA;      aria-labelledby=&#34;release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0&#34;&#xA;      data-bs-parent=&#34;#release-00e1a56e10d6fc5c520d0ab116b5024e-page-0_accordion&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body&#34;&gt;&lt;ul class=&#34;list-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;li class=&#34;list-group-item my-auto&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Repair site navigation and simplify the homepage&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Show one homepage panel with vertically stacked GitHub and Docs rows using&#xA;the name: URL format, hiding the protocol and trailing slash in the link text.&#xA;Remove the separate Projects page and its header link, while keeping project&#xA;documentation under Docs. Remove the introductory homepage copy and visible title.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
